<title>SOUTH KOREA: CHO HUNG BANK H1 NET RISES 10.4 PCT.</title>
<headline>CHO HUNG BANK H1 NET RISES 10.4 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				379 vs 390</p>
<p>    Net				    70.48 vs 63.85</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		  80.28 vs    94.13</p>
<p>    Operating revenue	     1,442.53 vs 1,157.19</p>
<p>    Interest income		 1,190.13 vs   946.48</p>
<p>Note: Cho Hung Bank, one of South Korea's leading commercial banks, said its number of shares rose by 22,085,890 to 186,085,890 at the end of June from a year ago.</p>
</text>
